    "None of these accounts could be reached. Their servers may be busy — Discover has the pack, and says which ones." : "Nid oedd modd cyrraedd yr un o'r cyfrifon hyn. Efallai y bydd eu gweinyddion yn brysur - mae gan Discover y pecyn, ac mae'n dweud pa rai.",
    "_Followed %n account_::_Followed %n accounts_" : ["Wedi dilyn %n cyfrif", "Wedi dilyn %n cyfrif", "Wedi dilyn %n cyfrif", "Wedi dilyn %n cyfrif"],
    "Could not follow these accounts" : "Methu dilyn y cyfrifon hyn",
    "{followed} followed, {skipped} skipped, {failed} could not be reached" : "{followed} dilyn, {skipped} hepgor, {failed} methu cyrraedd",
    "Could not import those follows" : "Methu mewnforio'r rhai a ganlyn",
    "Getting started on the fediverse" : "Cychwyn ar y mediverse",
    "Steps" : "Camau",
    "Skip the introduction" : "Hepgor y cyflwyniad",
    "You are on the fediverse" : "Rydych chi ar y mediverse",
    "Your Nextcloud made you an account. This is your address — anyone on Mastodon, Pixelfed, PeerTube or any other server that speaks ActivityPub can follow it:" : "Gwnaeth eich Nextcloud gyfrif i chi. Dyma'ch cyfeiriad - gall unrhyw un ar Mastodon, Pixelfed, PeerTube neu unrhyw weinydd arall sy'n siarad ActivityPub ei ddilyn:",
    "Copied" : "Wedi'i gopïo",
    "Copy" : "Copi",
    "Give it to people the way you would an email address. Your profile, your avatar and your name come from your Nextcloud account and can be changed on your profile page." : "Rhowch ef i bobl fel y byddech chi'n rhoi cyfeiriad e-bost. Daw eich proffil, eich avatar a'ch enw o'ch cyfrif Nextcloud a gellir eu newid ar eich tudalen proffil.",
    "A feed is only as good as who is in it" : "Nid yw ymborth ond cystal a phwy sydd ynddo",
