    "People on your Nextcloud" : "Pobl ar eich Nextcloud",
    "Follow" : "Dilyn",
    "Looking around …" : "Edrych o gwmpas …",
    "Nobody on this Nextcloud has said where they are on the fediverse yet. You are the first — your handle is now on your Nextcloud profile, so the next person will see you here." : "Nid oes neb ar y Nextcloud hwn wedi dweud lle maen nhw ar y ffedives eto. Chi yw'r cyntaf - mae eich handlen bellach ar eich proffil Nextcloud, felly bydd y person nesaf yn eich gweld chi yma.",
    "Starter packs" : "Pecynnau cychwyn",
    "No starter packs on this server. Discover has suggestions and what is trending." : "Dim pecynnau cychwyn ar y gweinydd hwn. Mae gan Discover awgrymiadau a beth sy'n tueddu.",
    "Already somewhere else?" : "Yn rhywle arall yn barod?",
    "If you have an account on Mastodon or another server, bring the people you follow. Mastodon and servers like it export them as following_accounts.csv, Pixelfed as pixelfed-following.json — upload that file and each one is followed from here." : "Os oes gennych chi gyfrif ar Mastodon neu weinydd arall, dewch â'r bobl rydych chi'n eu dilyn. Mae Mastodon a gweinyddwyr yn eu hoffi yn eu hallforio fel following_accounts.csv, Pixelfed fel pixelfed-following.json — uwchlwythwch y ffeil honno a dilynir pob un o'r fan hon.",
    "Following …" : "Yn dilyn …",
    "Upload your follows" : "Llwythwch eich canlynol i fyny",
    "On Mastodon: Preferences → Import and export → Data export → Follows (CSV). Moving your followers over as well is in Settings, under Migration — that one is a one-way move, so it is not a button here." : "Ar Mastodon: Dewisiadau → Mewnforio ac allforio → Allforio data → Yn dilyn (CSV). Mae symud eich dilynwyr drosodd hefyd mewn Gosodiadau, o dan Mudo - symudiad unffordd yw'r un hwnnw, felly nid yw'n fotwm yma.",
    "That is all there is to it" : "Dyna'r cyfan sydd iddo",
    "Your feed fills up as the people you follow post. Meanwhile, say hello — a first post is how the fediverse finds out you are here." : "Mae eich porthiant yn llenwi wrth i'r bobl rydych chi'n eu dilyn bostio. Yn y cyfamser, dywedwch helo - post cyntaf yw sut mae'r ffedives yn darganfod eich bod chi yma.",
    "You have not followed anyone yet, and that is fine: Discover is always a click away in the sidebar. Say hello in the meantime — a first post is how the fediverse finds out you are here." : "Nid ydych wedi dilyn unrhyw un eto, ac mae hynny'n iawn: mae Discover bob amser yn clic i ffwrdd yn y bar ochr. Dywedwch helo yn y cyfamser - post cyntaf yw sut mae'r ffedives yn darganfod eich bod chi yma.",
