    "Public posts that were taken here, as their posters said. A place is never worked out from a picture — it is only ever what somebody chose to say." : "Swyddi cyhoeddus a gymerwyd yma, fel y dywedodd eu posteri. Nid yw lle byth yn cael ei weithio allan o lun - dim ond byth y mae rhywun yn dewis ei ddweud.",
