    "_picture posted_::_pictures posted_" : ["llun wedi'i bostio", "lluniau wedi'u postio", "lluniau wedi'u postio", "lluniau wedi'u postio"],
    "Settings → Your account → Download an archive of your data, and wait for the mail. Your posts and their pictures are in it. The accounts you followed are in it only as numbers, so there is nobody in that file to look up — and nothing on X federates, so no follower can come with you." : "Gosodiadau → Eich cyfrif → Lawrlwythwch archif o'ch data, ac arhoswch am y post. Mae eich postiadau a'u lluniau ynddo. Mae'r cyfrifon y gwnaethoch chi eu dilyn ynddo fel rhifau yn unig, felly nid oes neb yn y ffeil honno i edrych i fyny - a dim byd ar ffederasiynau X, felly ni all unrhyw ddilynwr ddod gyda chi.",
    "Settings → Accounts Centre → Your information and permissions → Download your information, and choose JSON. The HTML download holds the pages and not the posts. Your posts, your reels and the list of accounts you follow are all in that one file." : "Gosodiadau → Canolfan Cyfrifon → Eich gwybodaeth a chaniatâd → Lawrlwythwch eich gwybodaeth, a dewiswch JSON. Mae'r lawrlwythiad HTML yn dal y tudalennau ac nid y postiadau. Mae eich postiadau, eich riliau a'r rhestr o gyfrifon rydych chi'n eu dilyn i gyd yn yr un ffeil honno.",
    "Settings → Account → Download your data. The archive holds your videos as files rather than as posts, so there is nothing here that can read it as a timeline yet." : "Gosodiadau → Cyfrif → Lawrlwythwch eich data. Mae'r archif yn dal eich fideos fel ffeiliau yn hytrach nag fel postiadau, felly nid oes dim byd yma a all ei ddarllen fel llinell amser eto.",
    "TikTok posts cannot be imported from the archive yet. A video at a time can still be brought over by its address from Settings → Moving in, and everything below this step works the same." : "Ni ellir mewnforio postiadau TikTok o'r archif eto. Gellir dal i ddod â fideo ar y tro gan ei gyfeiriad o Gosodiadau → Symud i mewn, ac mae popeth o dan y cam hwn yn gweithio yr un peth.",
    "Google Takeout → YouTube and YouTube Music. The archive holds your videos as files rather than as posts, so there is nothing here that can read it as a timeline yet." : "Google Takeout → YouTube a YouTube Music. Mae'r archif yn dal eich fideos fel ffeiliau yn hytrach nag fel postiadau, felly nid oes dim byd yma a all ei ddarllen fel llinell amser eto.",
    "Your own uploads are yours to re-publish rather than something to import in bulk — they are whole videos, and each one belongs on a post you write." : "Eich uwchlwythiadau chi yw eich un chi i'w hailgyhoeddi yn hytrach na rhywbeth i'w fewnforio mewn swmp - fideos cyfan ydyn nhw, ac mae pob un yn perthyn i bost rydych chi'n ei ysgrifennu.",
    "_Brought over %n post._::_Brought over %n posts._" : ["Wedi dod â %n post drosodd.", "Wedi dod â %n post drosodd.", "Wedi dod â %n post drosodd.", "Wedi dod â %n post drosodd."],
    "There are more: run it again to carry on." : "Mae mwy: rhedeg eto i gario ymlaen.",
    "That archive could not be read" : "Nid oedd modd darllen yr archif honno",
    "That archive lists nobody to look up" : "Nid yw'r archif hwnnw'n rhestru neb i chwilio amdano",
    "Could not look those names up" : "Methu edrych ar yr enwau hynny",
    "Could not follow those accounts" : "Methu dilyn y cyfrifon hynny",
    "I have moved to the fediverse" : "Rwyf wedi symud i'r ffediverse",
    "Follow me from any fediverse account — no account here needed" : "Dilynwch fi o unrhyw gyfrif fferllyd - nid oes angen cyfrif yma",
    "Could not copy — the words are below, to select" : "Methu â chopïo - mae'r geiriau isod, i ddewis",
    "Move in from somewhere else" : "Symud i mewn o rywle arall",
    "Your posts, the people you follow and a way to tell everyone where you went. Nothing here is posted for you, and nothing leaves this server except the lookups you ask for." : "Eich postiadau, y bobl rydych chi'n eu dilyn a ffordd i ddweud wrth bawb ble aethoch chi. Nid oes dim yma yn cael ei bostio i chi, ac nid oes dim yn gadael y gweinydd hwn ac eithrio'r chwiliadau y gofynnwch amdanynt.",
    "Where are you coming from?" : "O ble wyt ti'n dod?",
    "Bring your posts" : "Dewch â'ch postiadau",
    "Reading your archive …" : "Wrth ddarllen eich archif …",
    "Choose your archive" : "Dewiswch eich archif",
    "Your posts are written here with the dates they were written on, and nothing is sent to anyone: importing cannot put years of old posts into other people's timelines." : "Ysgrifennir eich postiadau yma gyda'r dyddiadau y cawsant eu hysgrifennu arnynt, ac nid oes dim yn cael ei anfon at unrhyw un: ni all mewnforio roi blynyddoedd o hen bostiadau i linellau amser pobl eraill.",
    "Find the people you followed" : "Dewch o hyd i'r bobl y gwnaethoch chi eu dilyn",
    "Instagram names are Threads names, and Threads is part of the fediverse — so the accounts you already followed can be looked up here, one at a time, from the same archive. Everyone who answers is shown; nobody is followed until you say so." : "Mae enwau Instagram yn enwau Threads, ac mae Threads yn rhan o'r ffedives - felly gellir edrych ar y cyfrifon yr ydych eisoes wedi'u dilyn yma, un ar y tro, o'r un archif. Dangosir pawb sy'n ateb; does neb yn cael ei ddilyn nes i chi ddweud hynny.",
    "Read the list from my archive" : "Darllenwch y rhestr o fy archif",
    "Choose your archive above first" : "Dewiswch eich archif uchod yn gyntaf",
    "Keep looking" : "Daliwch ati i edrych",
    "Fill your feed" : "Llenwch eich porthiant",
    "A timeline here is what you followed and nothing else — there is no algorithm deciding what you get. Which means the first day is yours to fill: the starter packs are handfuls of accounts by subject, and following a hashtag brings in everyone who writes about it, whether you follow them or not." : "Llinell amser yma yw'r hyn y gwnaethoch ei ddilyn a dim byd arall - nid oes algorithm yn penderfynu beth a gewch. Sy'n golygu mai'ch diwrnod chi yw'r diwrnod cyntaf i'w lenwi: llond llaw o gyfrifon fesul pwnc yw'r pecynnau cychwynnol, ac mae dilyn hashnod yn dod â phawb sy'n ysgrifennu amdano, p'un a ydych chi'n eu dilyn ai peidio.",
    "Browse starter packs" : "Pori pecynnau cychwyn",
    "Follow hashtags" : "Dilynwch hashnodau",
    "Tell people where you went" : "Dywedwch wrth bobl ble aethoch chi",
    "The one part nobody can do for you: none of those networks lets another site post on your behalf. Here is the card and the words — put them where you used to be, once, and the people still there can find you." : "Yr un rhan na all neb ei wneud i chi: nid yw'r un o'r rhwydweithiau hynny yn gadael i wefan arall bostio ar eich rhan. Dyma'r cerdyn a'r geiriau - rhowch nhw lle roeddech chi'n arfer bod, unwaith, a gall y bobl sy'n dal yno ddod o hyd i chi.",
    "A card naming your new account" : "Cerdyn yn enwi eich cyfrif newydd",
